  "notes": "Warm off-white canvas (#f4f3ef) with deep navy top bar and a single mustard-yellow primary CTA ('Enable routine'). Step kinds are colour-coded consistently across icon tile, uppercase kind label and left accent bar: indigo trigger, amber condition, teal action, purple flow. Steps carry dry-run outcome pills (✓ time passed, ▶ time fired, × Not taken / Not reached) driven by the selected recorded day in the bottom dry-run panel—switching days re-evaluates all step statuses and the swimlane timeline (verified live). Each step toggles between plain-language summary and code view; the inspector shows a Visual/Code projection, token chips that insert identifiers into the expression, a per-clause truth breakdown, and a strip of true/false cells across the evening. Branch steps render as two side-by-side nested columns (If true tinted purple, Otherwise greyed when not taken). Clicking Add step opens a categorized 'Add a step' picker (Conditions/Actions/Flows) — live only. The distinctive character is the code-view projection between natural-language step summaries and a DSL."
